OL,3,GNEWSA'Royal Mail delays are costing my
OL,4,Alittle bakery'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA baker says delays with the Royal Mail
OL,7,Fparcel service are "really frustrating"
OL,8,Fand leaving her out of pocket.
OL,10,FSally Rees owns Wicked Cookies in
OL,11,FNuneaton and also a retail outlet,
OL,12,FSnickerwoodles in Leamington Spa. Both
OL,13,Fbusinesses sell regular and themed
OL,14,Fcookies, with a mail-order option.
OL,16,FHowever, she said that although 80% of
OL,17,Fdeliveries are made without issue, the
OL,18,Fsituation has worsened over the past
OL,19,Fthree months.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
