OL,3,GNEWSA'Royal Mail delays are costing my
OL,4,Alittle bakery'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"In the last three days we've had our
OL,7,Fpost collected, our parcels collected,
OL,8,Fbut the tracking system shows that they
OL,9,Fhaven't even made it to the depot and
OL,10,Fbeen checked in."
